content: reframe projects around AI Apps and Algorithm Engineer

- View Resume: image lightbox drops the 16:9 lock and fills available
  height (1200px x 88vh) for tall images like the resume scan
- Skills S/04: add 2026 National Scholarship and First-class Academic
  Scholarship; rank 3 of 20 updated to 2 of 20; section renamed to
  "Certifications & Awards"
- P/01 SGT-Aug: note "Accepted, EI indexed by Nov"; sub rephrased to
  mirror the resume language; training block now reports the +5.55 /
  +10.33 pp tail-class gain on VOC-LT / COCO-LT; paper and bibtex
  links marked as "coming soon" / "待补充"
- P/02 SlayQuiz: 4 desc blocks expanded to 6, covering the JD framing,
  Taro + TS + FastAPI stack, LangChain + DeepSeek + JSON Mode + Pydantic,
  async task + fault tolerance, Hybrid RAG + adaptive learning loop,
  and key results (P90 below 15s, dup rates); tags refreshed
- P/03 Strategem: 3 desc blocks expanded to 6, each grounded in the
  user-supplied brief (state machine + 96 percent routing accuracy,
  coverage-driven loop, dual retrieval with two-level dedup, four-level
  evidence chain + audit, ownership summary); tags refreshed
- All changes mirrored to en.html
